er than GPT, and you can get a lot more accurate results this way.","createdAt":"2024-09-05T06:48:37.119Z","edited":true,"likeCount":1,"liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"66d9547d9d6f1705360f8091","commentBy":{"_id":"65c83199eb4241264f86e738","username":"Suno","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a3da8297cb968232b2686864a8bc21d03b70ff53ca4159e14659a3636deb00a3.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/65c83199eb4241264f86e738-1775536174928.jpg"},"createdAt":"2024-02-11T02:31:53.507Z","lastActive":"2026-04-29T02:04:00.690Z","status":"offline","id":"65c83199eb4241264f86e738","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a3da8297cb968232b2686864a8bc21d03b70ff53ca4159e14659a3636deb00a3.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/65c83199eb4241264f86e738-1775536174928.jpg"}},"text":"Also, just use Claude's (or GPT's) API to make your script server-less... You don't even need your own server (not like it's hard to make anyway...)","createdAt":"2024-09-05T06:49:33.161Z","edited":true,"likeCount":1,"liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"66d954bb2b9cf6ab35504e9c","commentBy":{"_id":"65c83199eb4241264f86e738","username":"Suno","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a3da8297cb968232b2686864a8bc21d03b70ff53ca4159e14659a3636deb00a3.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/65c83199eb4241264f86e738-1775536174928.jpg"},"createdAt":"2024-02-11T02:31:53.507Z","lastActive":"2026-04-29T02:04:00.690Z","status":"offline","id":"65c83199eb4241264f86e738","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a3da8297cb968232b2686864a8bc21d03b70ff53ca4159e14659a3636deb00a3.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/65c83199eb4241264f86e738-1775536174928.jpg"}},"text":"This idea is good, however the fact you need a Python server just ruins it. Please work more on a project instead of just releasing..","createdAt":"2024-09-05T06:50:35.162Z","edited":true,"likeCount":1,"liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"66da4c669305e61b134455ca","commentBy":{"_id":"66921a29eb2c315b1fbc34c6","username":"melon","verified":true,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6ed635a5a209d0a6d981208ca2fbed8f3e8cb21ed8eeddc7e8dc623a40174686.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66921a29eb2c315b1fbc34c6-1720851036957.jpg"},"createdAt":"2024-07-13T06:09:45.742Z","lastActive":"2026-05-22T21:02:35.540Z","status":"offline","id":"66921a29eb2c315b1fbc34c6","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.followers","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6ed635a5a209d0a6d981208ca2fbed8f3e8cb21ed8eeddc7e8dc623a40174686.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66921a29eb2c315b1fbc34c6-1720851036957.jpg"}},"text":"Yeah, I originally wanted to do a python-less solution, but I couldn't seem to create a reverse proxy in lua so I decided to use a python backend instead to get access to models like gpt for free. Ill test out Claude to see the results and work on implementing a API that people can use. (VPS is being setup as we speak) Thanks for the feedback though, it's greatly appreciated! (@Suno)","createdAt":"2024-09-06T00:27:18.657Z","edited":true,"likeCount":1,"liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"66db92e4ae2847f399910448","commentBy":{"_id":"663cfa1a4d8171671b0b68e3","username":"playvora","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/415b2bf06476a7e00aeee978100c17192d6849f9e0e6cee89233754aaeb180d1.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/663cfa1a4d8171671b0b68e3-1775664315419.png"},"createdAt":"2024-05-09T16:30:18.318Z","lastActive":"2026-04-21T09:45:06.589Z","status":"offline","id":"663cfa1a4d8171671b0b68e3","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":25},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/415b2bf06476a7e00aeee978100c17192d6849f9e0e6cee89233754aaeb180d1.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/663cfa1a4d8171671b0b68e3-1775664315419.png"}},"text":"guys gu